%% D2 M2.5 — choosing a controller
graph TD
    Q1{"Does it run<br/>forever?"}
    Q2{"One per NODE?"}
    Q3{"Needs stable identity<br/>+ its own storage?"}
    Q4{"On a schedule?"}
    DEP["<b>Deployment</b><br/>N interchangeable replicas"]
    DS["<b>DaemonSet</b><br/>one per node · no replica count"]
    SS["<b>StatefulSet</b><br/>ordered · stable names + volumes<br/><i>Day 3</i>"]
    JOB["<b>Job</b><br/>run to completion · success = exit 0"]
    CJ["<b>CronJob</b><br/>creates a Job on a schedule"]
    Q1 -->|yes| Q2
    Q2 -->|yes| DS
    Q2 -->|no| Q3
    Q3 -->|yes| SS
    Q3 -->|no| DEP
    Q1 -->|no| Q4
    Q4 -->|yes| CJ
    Q4 -->|no| JOB
    style DS fill:#1f3b2b,stroke:#66bb6a,color:#fff
    style JOB fill:#3b2f1f,stroke:#ffa726,color:#fff
    style SS fill:#2b2b2b,stroke:#888,color:#aaa
